The Go Authors
--------------

The following components use software developed by The Go Authors:

* Portions of keccak_round_scalar_amd64.h and sponge_permute_amd64.s are
  adapted from Go's AMD64 SHA-3/Keccak implementation.
* Portions of keccak_round_neon_x2_arm64.h and sponge_permute_arm64.s are
  adapted from Go's ARM64 SHA-3/Keccak implementation.
Upstream sources:

* https://github.com/golang/go/tree/master/src/crypto/internal/fips140/sha3

The assembly adaptations extract or reorganize permutation rounds, use the
final 12 Keccak-p[1600,12] rounds, and integrate the code with kt128's local
state and absorb implementations.

