CRYPTOGAMS
----------

The AVX-512 x1 Keccak-p[1600,12] round macros in
keccak_round_avx512_x8_amd64.h, together with their constants and caller in
sponge_permute_amd64.s, are adapted from Andy Polyakov's CRYPTOGAMS
keccak1600-avx512.pl. The implementation was ported to Go Plan 9 assembly
and restricted to the final 12 rounds.

